OL,3,GNEWSAActress with cancer diagnosis back
OL,4,Aon stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur actress who was diagnosed
OL,7,Fwith breast cancer in March is back on
OL,8,Fstage performing after treatment
OL,9,Fincluding three weeks of radiotherapy.
OL,11,FBreast cancer is Guernsey's third most
OL,12,Fcommon cancer, causing about 12 to 13
OL,13,Fdeaths a year.
OL,15,FFor Breast Cancer Awareness Month,
OL,16,FMartine Legg said she wanted those
OL,17,Ffacing the condition to know "there are
OL,18,Fways forward there are lots of
OL,19,Fdifferent sort of routes you can go
OL,20,Fdown and the support over here is
OL,21,Ffantastic".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
